HST Office: open MathType 4-7 equations as Math formulas when the user asks for it.

New option Office.Common/Filter/Microsoft/Import/MathType5ToMath (default off). When it is on,
.doc/.xls/.ppt (msfilter) and .docx/.rtf (writerfilter) convert "Equation.DSMT4" OLE objects.
A formula that fails to convert keeps its OLE object. In Writer the converted formula is a
normal Math object on the Math baseline; Word's run position shift only applies to the OLE
objects that stay. The DOCX/RTF logic lives in sw/source/writerfilter/hst/.

